    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p>When you cast a manifestation, you may spend Resonance Dice (one at a time) to apply one benefit per die:</p><ul><li><p>+1 Resolve DC</p></li><li><p>Add one additional damage die (or equivalent potency)</p></li><li><p>Extend duration one step</p></li><li><p>Impose roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on one defense checks</p></li><li><p>Stabilize the manifestation against counter/dispels</p></li></ul><p>Each aggressive use may add Strain (GM adjudication) if you are forcing contradiction or misaligned power.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"clResChan\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Resonance Channel</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> Pool-spend  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Free (with manifestation)  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">Each Resonance Die spent stacks one Channel benefit on the manifestation. Aggressive use (forcing contradiction or misaligned power) may add Strain — GM call.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
